data: {"type":"response.completed","sequence_number":2297,"response":{"id":"resp_01f92f7c67e86beb016adb1e5248e481918e7ba4ade182efec","object":"response","created_at":1792745042,"completed_at":1792745067,"status":"completed","background":false,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"moderation":null,"model":"gpt-6-luna","access_programs":null,"previous_response_id":null,"instructions":"Complete the supplied mathematical task using only its explicit inputs and tools. Submit the requested JSON artifact through submit_artifact. Tool feedback is real task feedback; do not invent a successful check. This is a Yui workflow stage. Read the relevant declared Yui rules, preserve the supplied proof route and exact allowed assumptions, and distinguish mathematical review from structural checks.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_01f92f7c67e86beb016adb1e5528088191815813dc1760abf9","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq2x5VBzEJ3p44LRUny0PhTcUtQ4tXb_Uvhwzkc3_AkSn3zSJ6lErG8Keks4eSI4xOOO-GW6AL-qppm-jxYJQPP2LlBMevBxzZbRfjpqQvZAIhCI4H5PIsONa8IdlxpDH6meGXetnXsarwC8K7aAOR1UlCZA-DxYjerqGgLERyTMWUOvC9RGUy9U-PrI_KPCKxLR4DBi-aFFz8ePRzsf8ggFnf_dvYgADUQiIRbBvbz4N1vUX_-AwqDI62D3SzluwYBWdL8KHbF9oI6SIumJtXwPPATITsGCairO0FnK0UBtHFRBrld_Xy4KueIq6JBdCXBsA_TIAKnZCA_qb0QLcbjPgwKnihjs3GNfQ-UrxFgTFCl8BQS1h_jv_E_p8ggNBDbg-uIayACALjuRzTcivvST1ExvZkSHSXUHACdiizOLqocUx8KYxL5qBN-4SpPcim2whn0n0GeDZp4IItDkdiooQ16oB3QJeNOtxNH7Qw0LclNeWKQpwTrcLuxjzY0bexaZ6GdXssEsvbPQ1FeLBYXY1Eexlhsbu0h8aHchRbu57HZ02XXEkSLi2e-4T-jgD3yUKbrw9WpOjnd1gP7e_5RilJhCg8hJQgQsMZdEA_mrjtYcPbqh0ZLVX8JCiM7U0S-5sFwkZ-EeekdtadMtYEPmhItbg4vSO3BjHClGg5GXuRnf8elymMIWEgA7My0WxM1ax7rqxW6ydoaPJM952B99RvjS_f3H9IIN537uUUaQ3IQQbZNoD2hqSzTentJVl5572lGwqVRK5IN6cZGKGFlzyE2LDut1GnkXn8Wf67ARtMRxELIFGcVceHXegY0GTpzmHAMS76i-DqFuy0L2hfctRMI8QzZCBW8oIBYRNkdr_DqowfuIH4ylZh3YDE1_UXSJ_TXBRAYbEEa0pb-6IptZ8uHvw9mcLeaxbn6Ij-D6XabSHnvTTtjlpwBE-IkBPCbzVXan-7HdM8ZFJO2Jfm-Cww3cfzat4H8El65zKwNyZdBXNcA2EqTLkn16jIsIa_1zayDjqbIHhMgFMTxZHxVmguPar